#: ../../../platforms/atmelmegaavr_extra.rst:23
msgid ""
"In the case of external programmers, it's easy to brick a board simply by "
"specifying incorrect upload flags. It's highly recommended to use the :ref:"
"`projectconf_upload_command` option that gives the full control over flags "
"used for uploading. Please read :ref:`atmelavr_upload_via_programmer` for "
"more information."
msgstr ""

