#: ../../../platforms/atmelmegaavr_extra.rst:111
msgid "Fuses programming"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../platforms/atmelmegaavr_extra.rst:113
msgid ""
"PlatformIO has a built-in target called ``fuses`` for setting fuse bits. The "
"default fuse bits are predefined in the board manifest file in the ``fuses`` "
"section. For example, `fuses section for Arduino Nano Every board <https://"
"github.com/platformio/platform-atmelmegaavr/blob/develop/boards/nano_every."
"json>`_. To set fuse bits you need to use target ``fuses`` with :option:`pio "
"run --target` command."
msgstr ""

